{"seq":1,"slug":"better-sqlite3","title":"better-sqlite3 同步驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration/better-sqlite3","wordCount":639,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"better-sqlite3-同步驱动\">better-sqlite3 同步驱动</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>better-sqlite3</strong> 是 Node.js 生态中性能最高的 SQLite 驱动，核心特点是采用<strong>同步 API</strong>：它通过 N-API 直接绑定 SQLite C 库，调用时阻塞当前线程而非切换到 Worker 线程。这一设计与异步驱动（如 <code>node-sqlite3</code>）形成对比——省去线程调度开销，配合 Prepared Statements 与原生事务封装，可达到接近 C 库的性能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-better-sqlite3\">为什么选择 better-sqlite3</h2><p><strong>better-sqlite3</strong> 是 Node.js 生态中性能最高的 SQLite 驱动。与基于回调/Promise 的异步驱动（如 <code>sqlite3</code>）不同，better-sqlite3 采用<strong>同步 API</strong>（Synchronous API）设计，利用 N-API 直接绑定 SQLite C 库。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph better-sqlite3&#10;        APP1[Node.js 应用] --&gt;|同步调用| NAPI[N-API 绑定]&#10;        NAPI --&gt; SQLITE1[SQLite C 库]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph node-sqlite3&#10;        APP2[Node.js 应用] --&gt;|异步回调| WORKER[Worker 线程]&#10;        WORKER --&gt; SQLITE2[SQLite C 库]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph better-sqlite3\n        APP1[Node.js 应用] --&gt;|同步调用| NAPI[N-API 绑定]\n        NAPI --&gt; SQLITE1[SQLite C 库]\n    end\n    subgraph node-sqlite3\n        APP2[Node.js 应用] --&gt;|异步回调| WORKER[Worker 线程]\n        WORKER --&gt; SQLITE2[SQLite C 库]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>better-sqlite3</th>\n<th>node-sqlite3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API 风格</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>异步（回调/Promise）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>较慢（线程开销）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务支持</td>\n<td>原生 transaction()</td>\n<td>手动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prepared Stmt</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAL 模式</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>内置类型定义</td>\n<td>@types 包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本使用\">基本使用</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;const db = new Database(&#39;myapp.db&#39;);&#10;&#10;db.pragma(&#39;journal_mode = WAL&#39;);&#10;db.pragma(&#39;synchronous = NORMAL&#39;);&#10;db.pragma(&#39;cache_size = -64000&#39;);&#10;db.pragma(&#39;foreign_keys = ON&#39;);&#10;&#10;db.exec(`&#10;  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (&#10;    id    INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,&#10;    name  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    email TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;    age   INTEGER&#10;  ) STRICT&#10;`);&#10;&#10;const insert = db.prepare(&#39;INSERT INTO users (name, email, age) VALUES (?, ?, ?)&#39;);&#10;insert.run(&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;, 30);&#10;&#10;const user = db.prepare(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?&#39;).get(1);&#10;&#10;const allUsers = db.prepare(&#39;SELECT * FROM users&#39;).all();&#10;&#10;db.close();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myapp.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'journal_mode = WAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'synchronous = NORMAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cache_size = -64000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'foreign_keys = ON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    id    INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    name  TEXT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    email TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    age   INTEGER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ) STRICT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> insert</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO users (name, email, age) VALUES (?, ?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">insert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allUsers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>API 方法概览：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>.run()</td>\n<td>{ changes, lastInsertRowid }</td>\n<td>INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.get()</td>\n<td>单行对象 或 undefined</td>\n<td>查询单行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.all()</td>\n<td>对象数组</td>\n<td>查询多行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.iterate()</td>\n<td>迭代器</td>\n<td>大结果集逐行处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.pluck()</td>\n<td>Statement（只返回首列值）</td>\n<td>链式调用修饰符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.expand()</td>\n<td>Statement（嵌套对象按表名分组）</td>\n<td>链式调用修饰符</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"prepared-statements\">Prepared Statements</h2><p><strong>预编译语句</strong>（Prepared Statement）将 SQL 解析和编译与参数绑定分离，既提升性能又防止 SQL 注入。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const stmt = db.prepare(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = ? AND age &gt; ?&#39;);&#10;&#10;const result1 = stmt.all(&#39;北京&#39;, 25);&#10;const result2 = stmt.all(&#39;上海&#39;, 30);&#10;&#10;const namedStmt = db.prepare(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = @city AND age &gt; @minAge&#39;);&#10;const result3 = namedStmt.all({ city: &#39;深圳&#39;, minAge: 20 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stmt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = ? AND age > ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'上海'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> namedStmt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = @city AND age > @minAge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> namedStmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ city: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'深圳'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, minAge: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SQL[SQL 文本] --&gt;|prepare| COMPILED[编译后的字节码]&#10;    COMPILED --&gt;|bind + run| EXEC1[执行 1]&#10;    COMPILED --&gt;|bind + run| EXEC2[执行 2]&#10;    COMPILED --&gt;|bind + run| EXEC3[执行 N]\">graph LR\n    SQL[SQL 文本] --&gt;|prepare| COMPILED[编译后的字节码]\n    COMPILED --&gt;|bind + run| EXEC1[执行 1]\n    COMPILED --&gt;|bind + run| EXEC2[执行 2]\n    COMPILED --&gt;|bind + run| EXEC3[执行 N]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Prepared Statement 在 better-sqlite3 中是可重复使用的。编译一次后可以多次绑定不同参数执行，避免重复解析 SQL 的开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事务封装\">事务封装</h2><p>better-sqlite3 提供了优雅的 <code>transaction()</code> 方法来封装事务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const insertMany = db.transaction((users: Array&lt;{ name: string; email: string; age: number }&gt;) =&gt; {&#10;  const stmt = db.prepare(&#39;INSERT INTO users (name, email, age) VALUES (@name, @email, @age)&#39;);&#10;  for (const user of users) {&#10;    stmt.run(user);&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;insertMany([&#10;  { name: &#39;Bob&#39;, email: &#39;bob@example.com&#39;, age: 25 },&#10;  { name: &#39;Carol&#39;, email: &#39;carol@example.com&#39;, age: 28 },&#10;  { name: &#39;Dave&#39;, email: &#39;dave@example.com&#39;, age: 35 },&#10;]);&#10;&#10;const transfer = db.transaction((from: number, to: number, amount: number) =&gt; {&#10;  const withdraw = db.prepare(&#39;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - ? WHERE id = ?&#39;);&#10;  const deposit = db.prepare(&#39;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + ? WHERE id = ?&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const result = withdraw.run(amount, from);&#10;  if (result.changes === 0) throw new Error(&#39;账户不存在&#39;);&#10;&#10;  deposit.run(amount, to);&#10;});&#10;&#10;transfer(1, 2, 100);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> insertMany</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stmt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span