\n    Prepared Statements\n      编译一次\n      多次执行\n      命名参数\n    事务封装\n      transaction&amp;#40;&amp;#41;\n      自动回滚\n      嵌套保存点\n    批量操作\n      事务包装\n      100x 性能提升\n    扩展功能\n      自定义函数\n      自定义聚合</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>better-sqlite3</strong> 是 Node.js 中性能最优的 SQLite 驱动，采用同步 API 设计。</li>\n<li><strong>Prepared Statements</strong> 编译一次多次执行，兼顾性能和安全。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>transaction()</code> 封装事务，<strong>批量写入性能可提升 100 倍以上</strong>。</li>\n<li>支持<strong>自定义标量函数和聚合函数</strong>，扩展 SQL 的计算能力。</li>\n<li>连接创建时应设置好 WAL 模式、缓存大小、外键约束等关键 Pragma。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"better-sqlite3 同步驱动","id":"better-sqlite3-同步驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么选择 better-sqlite3","id":"为什么选择-better-sqlite3"},{"level":2,"text":"基本使用","id":"基本使用"},{"level":2,"text":"Prepared Statements","id":"prepared-statements"},{"level":2,"text":"事务封装","id":"事务封装"},{"level":2,"text":"批量操作性能","id":"批量操作性能"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义函数与聚合","id":"自定义函数与聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/memory-and-tuning"},"next":{"title":"数据库迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration/migrations"}}